WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.211 --> 00:00:01.312
&gt;&gt; Important point.

00:00:01.446 --> 00:00:03.948
Sam kylie, thank you very much.

00:00:04.082 --> 00:00:07.819
Let's discuss what's going on.

00:00:07.952 --> 00:00:11.723
Joining us now, the nato deputy

00:00:11.856 --> 00:00:12.223
secretary general.

00:00:12.357 --> 00:00:13.258
Thank you very much, Mr.

00:00:13.391 --> 00:00:15.093
Secretary general, for joining

00:00:15.159 --> 00:00:15.293
us.

00:00:15.426 --> 00:00:17.095
Former Romanian ambassador to

00:00:17.128 --> 00:00:17.528
the United States.

00:00:17.662 --> 00:00:19.364
What's your reaction to Russia

00:00:19.497 --> 00:00:21.466
trying to destroy these patriot

00:00:21.599 --> 00:00:24.235
air defense missile battery that

00:00:24.369 --> 00:00:26.371
the Ukrainians received from the

00:00:26.504 --> 00:00:27.105
United States?

00:00:27.105 --> 00:00:29.474
&gt;&gt; It's clear the support all

00:00:29.607 --> 00:00:31.409
allies and I like to thank

00:00:31.542 --> 00:00:37.382
United States for delivering

00:00:37.515 --> 00:00:39.117
military support to Ukraine, the

00:00:39.183 --> 00:00:40.051
military build up of Ukraine and

00:00:40.184 --> 00:00:42.487
the training they do on very

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.088
sophisticated nato type

00:00:44.222 --> 00:00:45.823
equipment is of course a concern

00:00:45.957 --> 00:00:47.825
to Russia.

00:00:47.959 --> 00:00:49.594
Because Russia has quantity.

00:00:49.727 --> 00:00:51.329
And they should still be

00:00:51.462 --> 00:00:54.365
reckoned with because they are

00:00:54.499 --> 00:00:57.135
amassing you know, quantity of

00:00:57.235 --> 00:00:58.603
troops and disregard for the

00:00:58.736 --> 00:01:00.505
losses they have and Ukraine has

00:01:00.638 --> 00:01:02.707
advanced sophisticated western

00:01:03.141 --> 00:01:03.174
weapons.

00:01:03.174 --> 00:01:03.975
Of course for Russia, that's a

00:01:04.108 --> 00:01:05.143
matter of concern.

00:01:05.143 --> 00:01:09.314
I have high confidence that the

00:01:09.447 --> 00:01:10.715
sophistication of patriot

00:01:11.149 --> 00:01:12.116
missile system and also the

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:15.787
fantastic speed and agility,

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.388
ingenuity of Ukrainians learning

00:01:17.522 --> 00:01:19.557
to use these things.

00:01:19.691 --> 00:01:21.159
&gt;&gt; It's been very impressive how

00:01:21.292 --> 00:01:23.161
the Ukrainians have learned to

00:01:23.161 --> 00:01:23.494
use these.

00:01:23.628 --> 00:01:25.163
&gt;&gt; Our guys training them in

00:01:25.163 --> 00:01:28.533
America, in Europe, everywhere,

00:01:28.666 --> 00:01:30.835
they're really impressed by the

00:01:31.169 --> 00:01:31.269
speed.

00:01:31.269 --> 00:01:32.804
&gt;&gt; How significant is it right

00:01:33.171 --> 00:01:33.805
now, secretary general, that

00:01:33.938 --> 00:01:40.278
Russia is admitting losses in

00:01:40.411 --> 00:01:42.013
bah mood as Russia strikes

00:01:42.146 --> 00:01:43.881
deeper and deeper?

00:01:44.015 --> 00:01:47.185
&gt;&gt; The situation, very long

00:01:47.185 --> 00:01:52.357
front in Ukraine is very fluid.

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:55.193
We can really witness some

00:01:55.193 --> 00:01:56.127
significant advances in the area

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.296
by the Ukrainians.

00:01:58.429 --> 00:01:59.497
They have the capability to

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:01.199
launch such an offensive.

00:02:01.232 --> 00:02:02.200
&gt;&gt; Ukrainians.

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:05.203
&gt;&gt; Ukrainians.

00:02:05.203 --> 00:02:07.538
They are really mobilizing

00:02:07.672 --> 00:02:10.174
troops, equipment, command and

00:02:10.308 --> 00:02:11.376
control.

00:02:11.509 --> 00:02:14.245
But they're also cautioned to

00:02:14.379 --> 00:02:15.313
the fact that Russia is there

00:02:15.446 --> 00:02:18.049
with hundreds of kilometers of

00:02:18.182 --> 00:02:19.417
three lines of defenses.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:21.219
They still have quantity.

00:02:21.219 --> 00:02:22.587
Ukraine has quality.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:25.223
Russia has quality.

00:02:25.289 --> 00:02:27.959
So we know that Ukraine has the

00:02:28.092 --> 00:02:31.229
capacity to launch an offensive

00:02:31.295 --> 00:02:33.965
but to be careful and candid in

00:02:34.098 --> 00:02:36.567
saying Russia will pose very

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:39.971
fierce resistance ton the front

00:02:40.104 --> 00:02:40.271
line.

00:02:40.405 --> 00:02:42.140
&gt;&gt; The British foreign secretary

00:02:42.273 --> 00:02:43.441
says they may not achieve a

00:02:43.574 --> 00:02:44.475
quick, decisive breakthrough in

00:02:44.609 --> 00:02:46.844
this expected Ukrainian

00:02:47.245 --> 00:02:48.012
counteroffensive against the

00:02:48.146 --> 00:02:51.282
Russians but do you agree that

00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:52.283
Ukraine will need to manage

00:02:52.417 --> 00:02:53.251
expectations here?

00:02:53.251 --> 00:02:53.818
&gt;&gt; It's important and I have to

00:02:53.951 --> 00:02:55.887
say that the one huge difference

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:58.022
between Ukraine and Russia in

00:02:58.156 --> 00:03:00.391
terms of the troops is the level

00:03:00.525 --> 00:03:01.726
of morale.

00:03:01.859 --> 00:03:02.794
Ukrainians are fighting for

00:03:02.927 --> 00:03:03.428
their land.

00:03:03.561 --> 00:03:05.797
They're doing a superb and

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.432
heroic job and you see that in

00:03:07.565 --> 00:03:09.267
the way in which they defend

00:03:09.267 --> 00:03:10.168
their freedom.

00:03:10.301 --> 00:03:12.336
Russia's morale is very, very

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:12.603
low.

00:03:12.737 --> 00:03:13.738
That's why it's very important

00:03:13.871 --> 00:03:20.111
also for Ukraine to

00:03:20.244 --> 00:03:22.313
strategically communicate

00:03:22.447 --> 00:03:22.880
expectations.

00:03:23.281 --> 00:03:23.948
I would also say probably the

00:03:24.081 --> 00:03:26.417
next few months would be an

00:03:26.551 --> 00:03:27.385
indication, not necessarily in a

00:03:27.518 --> 00:03:30.321
few days, an indication of the

00:03:30.455 --> 00:03:31.989
tide and we hope and know that

00:03:32.123 --> 00:03:34.025
Ukraine has the capacity and the

00:03:34.158 --> 00:03:34.358
will --

00:03:34.492 --> 00:03:37.662
&gt;&gt; Very quickly, you're the nato

00:03:37.795 --> 00:03:38.729
deputy secretary general.

00:03:38.863 --> 00:03:40.598
Before I let you go.

00:03:40.731 --> 00:03:43.301
President zelenskyy of Ukraine

00:03:43.301 --> 00:03:43.935
today said he needs clear

00:03:44.068 --> 00:03:45.403
signals about Ukraine's future

00:03:45.536 --> 00:03:46.204
with nato.

00:03:46.337 --> 00:03:48.473
What, if any, future does

00:03:48.606 --> 00:03:50.141
Ukraine have with nato?

00:03:50.274 --> 00:03:52.677
&gt;&gt; Ukraine deserves and belongs

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.480
to civilized Europe.

00:03:55.613 --> 00:03:58.382
Ukraine has defended heroically

00:03:58.516 --> 00:04:01.319
its freedom.

00:04:01.319 --> 00:04:01.652
It's also defending our

00:04:01.786 --> 00:04:02.019
interest.

00:04:02.153 --> 00:04:04.422
I cannot say in which

00:04:04.555 --> 00:04:05.690
circumstances the institutional

00:04:05.823 --> 00:04:07.425
part of the integration into the

00:04:07.558 --> 00:04:08.759
west would happen but I know

00:04:08.893 --> 00:04:10.394
that the place that Ukraine is

00:04:10.528 --> 00:04:11.929
with us in civilized Europe part

00:04:12.063 --> 00:04:13.631
of the family of democracies.

00:04:13.764 --> 00:04:14.565
They earned it.

